@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Play offline and update later
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
actor "Child" as actor
box "Frontend — pibbo application" #E0F2FE
  participant "Home" as home
end box
box "Browser" #FFF4E5
  participant "Service worker" as sw
end box
actor -> home : touches an activity
home -> sw : GET the activity's code
alt cached
  sw --> home : cached code
  home --> actor : opens and plays fully, recordings from the cache [L2-033 #1]
else offline and uncached
  sw --> home : network error
  home --> actor : greyed picture + no-network symbol; does not open [L2-033 #2]
end
sw -> sw : new sw.js installs in the background and waits
sw --> home : takes over when Pibbo is next opened [L2-033 #3]
@enduml
